# OpenAI API Configuration
# Replace 'your-openai-api-key-here' with your actual OpenAI API key
# Get your API key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys

OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key-here

# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to create your own .env file
# 2. Replace the placeholder with your actual OpenAI API key
# 3. Never commit your actual API key to version control
# 4. Add .env to your .gitignore file to keep your keys secure
